title: $:/language/hypergsd/Settings/

# Settings surface strings. Keys are referenced either via <<lingo>> after a
# \procedure lingo-base() override, or as {{$:/language/...}} transclusions in
# caption/description fields (the ItemTemplate wikifies both).

# Root settings tab ($:/plugins/yan/hypergsd/ui/control-panel)
Root/Caption: HyperGSD

# Behaviour settings tab ($:/plugins/yan/hypergsd/ui/control-panel/behaviour)
Behaviour/Caption: Behaviour
Behaviour/NewActionNavigate: Navigate to new actions upon creation
Behaviour/NewProjectNavigate: Navigate to new projects upon creation
Behaviour/InheritTags: Inherit the tiddler's tags when creating from its panel
Behaviour/InheritTags/Prompt: Enable to have new items copy the tiddler's non-GSD tags. Certain GSD tags, such as realms, are inherited separately and are not affected by this setting.
Behaviour/PickerInstantCommit: Commit picker selections instantly:
Behaviour/PickerInstantCommit/Fine: For fine pointers (mouse input)
Behaviour/PickerInstantCommit/Coarse: For coarse pointers (touch input)
Behaviour/CloseOnComplete: Close tiddlers when marked as complete:
Behaviour/CloseOnComplete/Never: Never
Behaviour/CloseOnComplete/Itself: Only from the tiddler itself
Behaviour/CloseOnComplete/Always: From anywhere

# Panel and modal settings tab ($:/plugins/yan/hypergsd/ui/control-panel/sections)
PanelModal/Caption: Panel and modal
# View placement settings tab ($:/plugins/yan/hypergsd/ui/control-panel/view-placement)
ViewPlacement/Caption: View placement
ViewPlacement/Prompt: Choose whether HyperGSD content appears above or below the tiddler's body text field.
ViewPlacement/Action: Action tiddlers
ViewPlacement/Project: Project tiddlers
ViewPlacement/Top: Top
ViewPlacement/Bottom: Bottom
PanelModal/Layout: Panel and modal layout
PanelModal/Layout/Vertical: Vertical
PanelModal/Layout/Horizontal: Horizontal
PanelModal/Sections: Section visibility
PanelModal/Prompt: Choose which sections are displayed in the view panel and the new-item modal. Drag and drop entries to change the ordering.
PanelModal/Panel: Panel sections
PanelModal/Modal: Modal sections
PanelModal/FoldedVisibility/Hint: Visibility when tiddler is folded
PanelModal/FoldedVisibility/Shown: Shown when folded
PanelModal/FoldedVisibility/Hidden: Hidden when folded
PanelModal/PortionTop: Top, full-width
PanelModal/PortionFull: Bottom, full-width
PanelModal/Portion/Hint: Portions are the layout slots an entry renders in. Portions are the layout slots an entry renders in. Each portion is a tag named by adding a suffix -- such as `Portion/1` or `Portion/Top`, to this tag

# Lists settings tab ($:/plugins/yan/hypergsd/ui/control-panel/lists)
Lists/Caption: Lists
Lists/RealmWarning: Show warning on items outside of realm selection

# Project view settings tab ($:/plugins/yan/hypergsd/ui/control-panel/project-view)
ProjectView/Caption: Project view
ProjectView/Lists: Lists
ProjectView/Lists/Prompt: Choose which lists are displayed on a project tiddler. Drag and drop to change the ordering.

# Dashboards settings tab ($:/plugins/yan/hypergsd/ui/control-panel/dashboards)
Dashboards/Caption: Dashboards
Dashboards/General: General
Dashboards/FutureProjectItems: Show items under future projects
Dashboards/Grouping/Heading: Grouping options
Dashboards/Sorting/Heading: Sorting options
Dashboards/Lists: Lists
Dashboards/Lists/Prompt: Choose which lists are displayed in each dashboard. Drag and drop to change the ordering
Dashboards/Lists/DefaultOption: List default

# Sidebar settings tab ($:/plugins/yan/hypergsd/ui/control-panel/sidebar)
Sidebar/Caption: Sidebar
Sidebar/Prompt: Reorder or hide the entries in the capture and review sidebars.
Sidebar/CaptureHeading: Capture sidebar tab
Sidebar/ReviewHeading: Review sidebar tab
Sidebar/CaptureBlock/1: Capture defaults
Sidebar/CaptureBlock/2: New action, project and reference
Sidebar/CaptureBlock/3: New contact and context
Sidebar/CaptureBlock/4: Realm note
Sidebar/Block/1: Realm selection
Sidebar/Block/2: Project links
Sidebar/Block/3: Action links
Sidebar/Block/4: Contexts and ticklers
Sidebar/Block/5: References, contacts and cleanup

# Fragments settings tab ($:/plugins/yan/hypergsd/ui/control-panel/fragments)
Fragments/Caption: Fragments
Fragments/Prompt: Reorder or hide the fragments rendered in list rows and beside links.
Fragments/LinkItems/Label: Link items
Fragments/RowBefore/Label: List row items, before the tiddler title
Fragments/RowAfter/Label: List row items, after the tiddler title
Fragments/Complete/Caption: Completion checkbox
Fragments/Complete/Hint: Tick to complete the item; stamps the completion date and promotes dependants
Fragments/Status/Caption: Status selector
Fragments/Status/Hint: The status pills beside the title
Fragments/CompletionDate/Caption: Completion date
Fragments/CompletionDate/Hint: The stamped date shown on completed items
Fragments/BodyText/Caption: Body text indicator
Fragments/BodyText/Hint: Marks items that have body text
Fragments/Delete/Caption: Delete button
Fragments/Delete/Hint: Sends completed items to the trash bin
Fragments/RealmGlobe/Caption: Other realm indicator
Fragments/RealmGlobe/Hint: Marks rows that fall outside the current realm selection
Fragments/LinkRealmGlobe/Caption: Other realm indicator
Fragments/LinkRealmGlobe/Hint: Marks links whose target falls outside the current realm selection
Fragments/ProjectLink/Caption: Project link
Fragments/ProjectLink/Hint: Icon jumping to the item's project, hidden on the project tiddler and in lists grouped by project

# Colours settings tab ($:/plugins/yan/hypergsd/ui/control-panel/colours)
Colours/Caption: Colours
Colours/Prompt: Adjust the status colours for HyperGSD actions and projects.
Colours/DeleteNote: Colours are stored in [[$:/plugins/yan/hypergsd/ui/stylesheet/hgsd-status-colours]]. Delete it to restore the default colours.

# Keyboard shortcut descriptions ($:/plugins/yan/hypergsd/ui/config/ShortcutInfo/*)
Shortcuts/ModalClose: Close the HyperGSD creation modal
Shortcuts/ModalSubmit: Confirm and create the new HyperGSD item
Shortcuts/NewAction: Open the HyperGSD modal to create a new action
Shortcuts/NewProject: Open the HyperGSD modal to create a new project

# Dashboard page captions ($:/plugins/yan/hypergsd/ui/control-panel/dashboards/*-list)
Pages/Main/Caption: Dashboard
Pages/Action/Caption: Action dashboard
Pages/Project/Caption: Project dashboard
Pages/CompletedAction/Caption: Completed actions
Pages/CompletedProject/Caption: Completed projects
Pages/NoNextAction/Caption: No next action
Pages/Waiting/Caption: Waiting actions
Pages/Cleanup/Caption: Cleanup: completed items
Pages/CleanupOpenActions/Caption: Cleanup: open actions under completed projects

# List tiddler captions and hints ($:/plugins/yan/hypergsd/ui/lists/*)
Lists/NextActions/Caption: Next action list
Lists/NextActions/Hint: Incomplete actions with status next
Lists/FutureActions/Caption: Future action list
Lists/FutureActions/Hint: Incomplete actions with status future
Lists/WaitingActions/Caption: Waiting action list
Lists/WaitingActions/Hint: Incomplete actions with status waiting
Lists/CompletedActions/Caption: Completed action list
Lists/CompletedActions/Hint: Completed actions, newest completion first
Lists/CleanupActions/Caption: Completed action list
Lists/CleanupActions/Hint: Completed actions older than the cleanup age limit
Lists/ActiveProjects/Caption: Active project list
Lists/ActiveProjects/Hint: Projects with status active
Lists/FutureProjects/Caption: Future project List
Lists/FutureProjects/Hint: Projects with status future
Lists/CompletedProjects/Caption: Completed projects list
Lists/CompletedProjects/Hint: Completed projects
Lists/CleanupProjects/Caption: Completed project list
Lists/CleanupProjects/Hint: Completed projects older than the cleanup age limit
Lists/NoNextAction/Caption: No next action list
Lists/NoNextAction/Hint: Active projects that have no next action
Lists/IncompleteActionsUnderCompletedProjects/Caption: Incomplete actions under completed projects
TagBasis/Prompt: Tiddlers tagged with
TagBasis/Portions: Portions are the layout slots an entry renders in. Each portion is a tag named by adding a suffix -- such as `Portion/1` or `Portion/Top`, to this tag
